# L §4.1 "An open index gets its keys from the rows of inputs keyed by it": a3 is brought by no row, so a read at a3
# names no key (LOAD-KEY, L §8.3 table: a key not in its index).
=== m.tally
model op
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "umowa"
index accts: open
input acct_rank[a in accts]: int

version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  acct_rank[a1] = 1

ask q: acct_rank[a3]
=== expect
refused: LOAD-KEY a3 is not a key of accts ...
